  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven statement : **66 * 6 * 12 * 3 * 15 = 12**\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the * signs :\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : ÷, −, ×, +\n\n**66 ÷ 6**__ − 12 × 3 + 15 = 12\n\n11 − __**12 **____**×**____** 3**__ + 15 = 12\n\n__**11 +**____** 15**__ - 36 = 12\n\n__**26 - 36**__ = 12\n\n-10 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : +, −, ÷, ×\n\n66 + 6 − **12 ÷ 3**__ × 15 = 12\n\n66 + 6 − __**4 ×**____** 15**__ = 12\n\n__**66 +**____** 6**__ − 60 = 12\n\n__**72 - 60**__ = 12\n\n12 = 12 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : ÷, ×, +, −\n\n**66 ÷ 6**__ × 12 + 3 − 15 = 12\n\n__**11 ×**____** 12**__ + 3 − 15 = 12\n\n__**132 + 3**__ - 15 = 12\n\n135 - 15 = 12\n\n115 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : ×, −, ÷, +\n\n66 × 6 − **12 ÷ 3**__ + 15 = 12\n\n__**66 ×**____** 6**__ − 4 + 15 = 12\n\n__**396 + 15**__ - 4 = 12\n\n__**411 - 4**__ = 12\n\n407 ≠ 12 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (2)\" is the correct answer.",
